mechanics.behavior:
Data: Special Ice, BP 90, accuracy 100, priority 0. PP 10, Champions max 12. flags {protect, mirror, metronome}. target 'normal' (adjacent foe or ally). Secondary chance 10: status 'frz'. No champions override.

The secondary goes through runMoveEffects to trySetStatus, then setStatus. It fails with no message when:
- the target already has a status;
- the target has 0 HP;
- the target is Ice type (typechart frz immunity; no Ice types on either team);
- the Immunity event fails under sun: the sunnyday onImmunity returns false for 'frz'. This is reachable via ally Mega Charizard Y.

Effectiveness: 2x vs Rillaboom, Staraptor and Staraptor-Mega; 0.5x vs Milotic, Ceruledge, Gholdengo and Golisopod(-Mega) (the latter only as an ally target); neutral otherwise. No STAB, not boosted by Mystic Water, not changed by rain.
